FUNCTIONALITY:

:: Connecting ::

If the user clicks on the menu item "connect" he should
be prompted with a dialog box for connecting
the dialog might have it's own class..etc e.g connect_dialog. The dialog
should ask the user for a name, host, and port the host is listening on.
After that a connection should be atempted.
----------------------------------------------------------

:: Hosting ::

If the user clicks on the menu item "host" he should be prompted with a dialog for hosting
the dialog will have it's own class e.g host_dialog. The dialog should ask for the users name and
listening port. a message should then be displayed on the TextView widget, example "--- All ready ---"

:: After connecting, or hosting ::

The user is free to run chatnet server commands

:: Client server handler ::
This thread function will be responsilble for handling messages that arrive
from the server /msg,/xchat,/list...etc after it receives something like that it will see
what to do wheather to display the received data on textview...etc

:: synchronize clients ::
This thread function is responsible for updating the connected clients
list of chatnetgui and displaying them.

